  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Thickly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with half the Mumbai spice blend and season with pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your tray is getting crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395824f7d5496ac4a6f1a3/step-2feeb100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and garlic.\n• Rinse red lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395824f7d5496ac4a6f1a3/step-4fad8d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 15 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat the plant-based butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic, remaining Mumbai spice blend, lentils and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add coconut milk, the water and stock concentrate. Bring to a simmer, then reduce heat to low. Cover with a lid and simmer for 3-6 minutes until thickened.\n• Uncover, then continue to simmer until tender, 10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395824f7d5496ac4a6f1a3/step-1ab24020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) in batches, until golden, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395824f7d5496ac4a6f1a3/step-7d37b430.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the lentils are ready, add roasted veggies to the pan.\n• Gently stir to combine, then season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395824f7d5496ac4a6f1a3/step-1383cf40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop coriander.\n• Divide cauliflower and lentil aloo gobi between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over coriander and remaining chilli flakes.\n• Serve with toasted tortillas. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395824f7d5496ac4a6f1a3/step-da568a50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
